Subject: Adapt original GL views, frame sorters and slot pools for native rendering
Upstream-base: d6850f8dae162827f94d3f9b01a91538c02849dd

Keep the original view traversal, per-layer AVL sorting, packet callback flags
and pool algorithms. Allocate sorter tables lazily after game memory startup;
release them before arena shutdown, reject cyclic/deep ownership graphs and
expired frame packet lists. Sort using a 32-bit priority plus a complete native
packet pointer. Preserve signed sort layers and defined Wii depth conversion.
Select original projection/count helpers without the incomplete full startup.

